WEBVTT

00:19.706 --> 00:24.257
<i>With UMA Burn in tow, Billy tries to make off
with the Roundtable and Apocalypse.</i>

00:24.423 --> 00:29.433
<i>To prevent him from doing so,
the Union goes all out to support Fuko and Andy.</i>

00:29.433 --> 00:32.064
<i>Thanks to the efforst of the lab members
and Mico along with Fuko's unluck,</i>

00:32.064 --> 00:35.070
<i>it seemed like they succeeded at one point
to stop Burn in its tracks.</i>

00:35.070 --> 00:37.116
<i>But before Billy who controls multiple Negator abilities,</i>

00:37.116 --> 00:39.997
<i>Andy is forced to take distance from the Roundtable.</i>

00:40.414 --> 00:44.798
<i>With nothing barring his way,
Billy succeeds to make it up to the surface.</i>

00:44.881 --> 00:49.600
<i>However, through Tatiana's arrival
and release of her Untouchable Area,</i>

00:49.600 --> 00:52.939
<i>Fuko and Andy find an opening
and peel Apocalypse away from the Roundtable.</i>

00:53.106 --> 00:57.072
<i>Fuko takes psychological damage
from the immense amount of information flooding in</i>

00:57.072 --> 01:01.832
<i>due to direct contact with Apocalypse,
but the Union manages to regain control of the book.</i>

01:02.124 --> 01:04.963
<i>Thus, Billy and his group seize only
the Roundtable before departing...</i>

01:05.757 --> 01:08.596
<i>...leaving behind a mysterious term, "Ark."</i>

01:08.721 --> 01:13.063
<i>The battle ends,
and Juiz faces the wounded Union Headquarters.</i>

01:13.063 --> 01:17.279
<i>She gathers everyone up,
saying she wants to tell something to Roundtable members.</i>

01:25.253 --> 01:26.422
Are we all assembled?

01:26.673 --> 01:27.592
Lemme out!

01:27.592 --> 01:30.472
You better all know what's gonna happen
if you do crap like this!

01:30.472 --> 01:35.525
Look at that damn rookie takin' a nap over there!
I'll turn your brains into mush, just like hers!

01:35.525 --> 01:38.989
Or, I'll crunch your ribs with my jaws
and make a paste outta your internal org-

03:10.422 --> 03:12.635
You ain't gettin' away with this anymore!

03:12.635 --> 03:14.639
Mere Negators can't-

03:17.729 --> 03:19.858
Nico, damage report.

03:20.108 --> 03:23.364
Aye... well, it's not as bad as we thought.

03:24.074 --> 03:28.124
Forcing a draw by stealing Apocalypse
was the right call.

03:28.124 --> 03:31.339
If another fight had broken out,
would've been a lot worse.

03:32.382 --> 03:33.092
I see.

03:35.640 --> 03:37.184
Will Fuko be all right?

03:37.518 --> 03:38.979
Well, Nico?

03:39.229 --> 03:43.196
She'll settle down soon enough.
The human brain is a remarkable thing.

03:44.239 --> 03:45.367
There you have it.

03:46.870 --> 03:49.375
I see. Sorry about that.

03:52.464 --> 03:54.719
So... mind if I pose a question?

03:55.303 --> 03:57.642
Sure. That's why we're here.

03:58.309 --> 04:00.898
The first time I felt something was off...

04:00.898 --> 04:04.614
...was when I heard your policy regarding
the quests with Galaxy as the penalty.

04:06.325 --> 04:07.787
AUGUST 6TH

04:07.787 --> 04:09.331
MIDNIGHT

04:10.417 --> 04:18.224
You have until August 31st.
If all quests are not fulfilled, the penalty will be...

04:19.894 --> 04:22.567
...the addition of UMA Galaxy!

04:23.192 --> 04:29.121
Very well. Then, we'll first mobilize all members
toward clearing quests one, two, and three.

04:29.121 --> 04:31.000
We'll accept the penalty.

04:31.000 --> 04:33.714
This time we'll focus on strengthening our forces.

04:36.427 --> 04:42.147
You said outright there's no intent on clearing all
the Quests, just strengthening our forces.

04:42.481 --> 04:46.030
In retrospect, that's a pretty lax attitude to take.

04:48.284 --> 04:51.875
You would run the risk of losing members
for the Roundtable...

04:51.875 --> 04:55.131
But with Ragnarøk drawing near,
that's way too passive.

04:55.131 --> 04:56.593
AUGUST 6TH

04:56.593 --> 04:58.137
MIDNIGHT

04:58.262 --> 04:59.599
Ninety-eight times.

05:01.143 --> 05:03.732
That is the number of times Rules
have been added to Earth.

05:04.483 --> 05:08.241
Once every three months,
new penalties are added even without our intervention.

05:08.992 --> 05:10.411
Which is why we intervene.

05:10.411 --> 05:11.873
SEPTEMBER 1ST

05:11.873 --> 05:13.417
DARK BEFORE DAWN

05:14.086 --> 05:17.050
This marks the ninety-ninth penalty added.

05:17.802 --> 05:20.599
We cannot afford any more penalties.

05:20.891 --> 05:23.062
<i>There is only one open slot left until it reaches 100.</i>

05:24.022 --> 05:27.445
<i>Beyond that lies the final penalty.</i>

05:28.406 --> 05:29.659
<i>Ragnarøk.</i>

05:34.334 --> 05:38.009
I've been curious about your familiarity
with Victhor as well.

05:38.009 --> 05:43.352
I thought that you only knew him
as a hero that existed before we were born.

05:43.562 --> 05:47.068
But apparently you two called each other
by name while engaged in battle.

05:47.068 --> 05:48.404
AUGUST 24TH

05:48.404 --> 05:49.991
SUNSET

05:52.538 --> 05:53.456
A flaming sword!

05:53.999 --> 05:55.628
Not bad, Juiz.

05:56.337 --> 06:01.806
Those who lack justice and ambition
cannot influence the actions of others, Victor.

06:05.606 --> 06:12.369
I later heard that Mr. Andy hadn't let him
fully out in close to 200 years.

06:12.369 --> 06:13.705
AUGUST 1ST

06:13.705 --> 06:15.291
CLOUDS GATHERING

06:15.793 --> 06:19.216
Amateur, eh? Maybe now...

06:19.717 --> 06:21.387
But the past is a different story!

06:22.264 --> 06:24.393
<i>Usually, I don't have enough space for it all.</i>

06:24.393 --> 06:26.523
<i>So I put a cork in my brain...</i>

06:26.523 --> 06:29.403
<i>...to keep 100 years' worth
of memories bottled up!</i>

06:33.662 --> 06:34.998
AUGUST 24TH

06:34.998 --> 06:36.584
EARLY EVENING

06:47.480 --> 06:53.409
In addition, he seemed to know
of Galaxy's existence before the Rule was even added.

06:53.409 --> 06:54.746
AUGUST 24TH

06:54.746 --> 06:56.331
DUSK

06:57.417 --> 06:59.881
What year and month is it?

07:00.591 --> 07:04.056
August 24th, 2020.

07:04.473 --> 07:05.559
What day of the week is it?

07:05.934 --> 07:08.857
Day of the week?
What're you talking about?

07:10.819 --> 07:12.155
SEPTEMBER 1ST

07:12.155 --> 07:13.742
MIDNIGHT

07:15.119 --> 07:17.875
All quests have not been cleared.

07:17.875 --> 07:19.921
Therefore, you shall receive a penalty.

07:20.171 --> 07:22.927
Now adding the UMA Galaxy!

07:40.921 --> 07:45.471
It was almost as if he had lived in
a world where Galaxy already existed.

07:45.639 --> 07:48.937
This Ark thing Billy mentioned
has me curious, too.

07:48.937 --> 07:50.273
DECEMBER 1ST

07:50.273 --> 07:51.860
MIDNIGHT

07:52.653 --> 07:53.905
Undead.

07:54.281 --> 07:56.661
We will be securing Ark.

07:56.661 --> 08:00.919
Tell Juiz that we won't let her have it.

08:03.215 --> 08:07.098
The Union doesn't have any data logged
for an Artifact named Ark.

08:17.536 --> 08:18.830
Don't worry.

08:19.582 --> 08:21.544
In this state, my ability...

08:21.544 --> 08:24.926
...won't be an issue unless you answer
a question from me concerning justice.

08:30.520 --> 08:34.069
First off, there's something about
this world that you all need to know.

08:35.488 --> 08:36.991
This world...

08:38.077 --> 08:38.912
...is on a Loop.

08:49.391 --> 08:53.650
It's in a constant cycle of destruction and renewal,
by God's hand.

08:54.025 --> 08:55.779
Time and time again.

08:56.280 --> 08:59.745
The Union is an organization I created
to put a stop to that.

09:04.672 --> 09:06.133
A-A loop?

09:06.634 --> 09:08.137
This world is?

09:08.345 --> 09:09.765
What's a "Loop"?

09:10.182 --> 09:15.067
Um, well... like the world is repeating
the same events over and over?

09:15.443 --> 09:16.278
I see now.

09:16.946 --> 09:19.451
I couldn't really tell since they were all fragmented...

09:19.451 --> 09:25.379
...but the images from Artifacts
are from before things were re-created?

09:26.549 --> 09:27.509
Correct.

09:35.483 --> 09:37.988
It's the history of our-no...

09:38.782 --> 09:42.163
It's the history of my inadequacy leading to defeat.

09:42.330 --> 09:44.417
No! Ms. Juiz, without you around-

09:44.502 --> 09:45.378
But that is precisely why...

09:47.090 --> 09:48.718
That's precisely why I assembled them!

09:49.553 --> 09:51.516
All encountered over the course
of countless deaths...

09:51.891 --> 09:54.689
...stronger weapons and warriors!

09:56.943 --> 10:00.157
I've assembled Negators capable of killing God!

10:19.028 --> 10:21.576
Okay, let's say this Loop is real.

10:21.576 --> 10:23.955
Why is it that you're
the only one who knows?

10:24.497 --> 10:28.464
We're all Negators here,
yet we're all clueless to that fact.

10:28.673 --> 10:32.931
Oh, that's right. We should be aware
of the world before it changed.

10:32.931 --> 10:34.267
SEPTEMBER 1ST

10:34.267 --> 10:35.854
MIDNIGHT

10:36.188 --> 10:40.196
Altering the memories and cultures
of all non-Negators.

10:40.196 --> 10:43.035
All languages have now been unified to English.

10:43.368 --> 10:44.830
Mui dear, do you read me?

10:46.333 --> 10:48.588
I'D LOVE SOME OF YOUR DIM SUM TODAY.
Wo jīntiān yào páo ni de dianxīn.

10:48.588 --> 10:49.255
Zěnme yàng?
HOW ABOUT IT?

10:50.550 --> 10:51.594
E-Er...

10:51.594 --> 10:52.930
SEPTEMBER 2ND

10:52.930 --> 10:54.558
EARLY MORNING

10:56.228 --> 10:57.271
Hey, Chikara!

10:57.648 --> 11:01.739
Gah, shut up! What's with everyone
suddenly speaking in English?

11:04.537 --> 11:05.622
Huh?

11:06.373 --> 11:07.458
Good point.

11:07.709 --> 11:10.130
But it could be something
from before we were born.

11:10.297 --> 11:13.011
There's no way we would know
if we never knew about it to begin with.

11:13.428 --> 11:14.347
Right.

11:14.347 --> 11:15.725
You know anything, old-timer?

11:16.561 --> 11:17.436
Nope.

11:17.938 --> 11:20.192
There are a number of ways
to find out about the Loop...

11:20.902 --> 11:26.706
...but as for me,
I've been using Ark to experience it firsthand.

11:31.381 --> 11:32.843
Can you give us proof?

11:33.176 --> 11:34.470
A-Andy!

11:35.180 --> 11:37.310
I'm not sure if it will serve as proof...

11:38.186 --> 11:42.069
...but I will describe how this world will end and begin.

12:00.982 --> 12:04.113
I'll start with how this world will end.

12:04.865 --> 12:09.667
This planet and all life
will be physically destroyed by God's hand.

12:16.179 --> 12:17.557
<i>Blown into literal bits.</i>

12:18.308 --> 12:20.396
Not even flying into space will save you.

12:20.730 --> 12:24.070
A-Are you saying everyone is going to die?

12:24.445 --> 12:25.532
Indeed.

12:28.538 --> 12:32.086
<i>Then a new planet will be formed by God.</i>

12:33.506 --> 12:38.599
<i>Sometimes, fragments of the old Earth
will remain around the new Earth.</i>

12:39.601 --> 12:40.436
Fuko...

12:40.770 --> 12:42.899
Those are the meteorites your Unluck summons.

12:44.653 --> 12:45.989
AUGUST 1ST

12:45.989 --> 12:47.576
CLOUDS GATHERING

12:57.386 --> 12:58.723
AUGUST 24TH

12:58.723 --> 13:00.309
TWILIGHT

13:10.914 --> 13:12.249
SEPTEMBER 9TH

13:12.249 --> 13:13.795
DEEP IN THE NIGHT

13:23.981 --> 13:26.444
You mean those are fragments from the old Earth?

13:29.158 --> 13:31.956
From when there were only the Earth, the Moon,
and the Sun.

13:31.956 --> 13:34.628
You were summoning them before Galaxy
was added, correct?

13:34.628 --> 13:36.381
PAST PRESENT

13:36.464 --> 13:39.596
SEPTEMBER 1ST
ADDITION OF GALAXY

13:40.138 --> 13:45.525
I was taught meteorites formed when
the Moon separated from the Earth.

13:45.525 --> 13:47.027
CLASS 6-2
FUKO IZUMO

13:48.614 --> 13:51.119
THE ORIGIN OF METEORITES
HOW WERE METEORITES FORMED?

13:53.039 --> 13:56.462
If we examine what makes up
a meteorite that falls from your unluck,

13:56.462 --> 14:01.932
we'd be forced to conclude from
its absurd makeup that the Earth had once shattered.

14:07.777 --> 14:12.286
I'm sorry, but that is all I have
to offer as proof of the world looping.

14:14.040 --> 14:16.962
As for proof of my own Loop...

14:17.463 --> 14:18.173
Andy?

14:18.465 --> 14:19.133
Hm?

14:20.010 --> 14:23.099
You have a mole right here
at the back of your right ear, don't you?

14:23.391 --> 14:24.268
- Wha?
- Wha?

14:25.688 --> 14:26.732
Do I?

14:29.070 --> 14:32.201
Whoa! It's true!
I can see it as soon as I pull back your ear!

14:32.201 --> 14:33.788
Ms. Juiz, when did you see this?

14:34.080 --> 14:36.585
I know it's a meager offering of proof...

14:36.585 --> 14:39.675
...but there aren't many things that remain
the same from the previous cycle.

14:40.384 --> 14:42.262
Will this serve to convince you?

14:46.312 --> 14:47.064
Wait a...

14:47.481 --> 14:49.318
Hold on, what's all this mean?

14:49.318 --> 14:50.028
Calm down.

14:50.195 --> 14:51.907
I am being calm!

14:52.449 --> 14:53.869
I wasn't involved.

14:54.328 --> 14:55.080
Whuh?

14:56.124 --> 14:58.629
Victor and you were mighty close, huh?

15:00.090 --> 15:01.635
It's ancient history.

15:02.554 --> 15:03.263
Huh?

15:05.685 --> 15:06.436
Huh?

15:08.649 --> 15:10.360
O-Okay, so basically!

15:10.611 --> 15:11.530
Hey, I said calm down.

15:11.613 --> 15:13.534
I am being calm!

15:13.909 --> 15:16.247
The world has been repeatedly getting destroyed!

15:16.247 --> 15:17.625
Everyone died!

15:17.709 --> 15:20.506
And by using this "Ark" thing,
Ms. Juiz has been the only one...

15:20.506 --> 15:23.763
...able to travel to the next new world in line-

15:24.346 --> 15:24.848
No.

15:25.933 --> 15:27.436
I wasn't alone.

15:28.313 --> 15:30.067
There was someone else?

15:30.902 --> 15:32.029
Now I see.

15:32.196 --> 15:35.202
She means me... no.
She means Victor.

15:35.703 --> 15:36.622
What do you mean?

15:37.331 --> 15:44.554
If the Loop destroys and reconstructs the planet...
then even if everyone else dies, I won't.

15:47.142 --> 15:48.478
AUGUST 1ST

15:48.478 --> 15:50.065
DAYBREAK

15:50.398 --> 15:52.862
I'm... Undead!

15:52.862 --> 15:53.864
UNDEAD

15:58.666 --> 16:01.170
Basically, Juiz used the Ark.

16:01.755 --> 16:02.882
<i>And Victor...</i>

16:03.466 --> 16:08.309
<i>He's been living in this world ever since
the Rule of Death was added.</i>

16:09.103 --> 16:15.323
Which means... even if the world ends,
I won't be able to die.

16:16.325 --> 16:17.537
Correct.

16:20.543 --> 16:21.460
Is that so.

16:21.670 --> 16:23.089
No way...

16:23.674 --> 16:26.053
There are two ways to avoid the Rules.

16:26.597 --> 16:27.765
You must either die...

16:28.517 --> 16:29.895
...or kill God.

16:45.300 --> 16:52.231
I withheld many secrets and manipulated
the very comrades risking their lives alongside me.

16:54.527 --> 16:59.411
Billy's insurrection was likely because news
of this Loop leaked somehow.

17:00.497 --> 17:02.417
I am fully responsible.

17:03.712 --> 17:04.506
Ms. Juiz!

17:05.215 --> 17:09.766
I would gladly atone for this with my death,
but there are things that must be done.

17:10.643 --> 17:11.520
Thus...

17:12.563 --> 17:15.443
Will you all follow me
and see this to the end?

17:15.569 --> 17:16.822
Wait a sec, Boss!

17:17.114 --> 17:19.201
Right now, this is all I can offer yo-

17:23.084 --> 17:24.461
Your doing, Shen?

17:24.921 --> 17:28.679
Please stop.
I'd rather not see you do things like that.

17:28.846 --> 17:29.889
Totally agree.

17:30.265 --> 17:32.812
That was only bits 'n' pieces of the story, but...

17:32.812 --> 17:37.070
...ya had some idea and tried
to put it into action alone, right?

17:37.404 --> 17:40.536
I'll believe it-your vision of justice.

17:57.110 --> 18:00.283
Wow, this Roundtable's pretty swank!
It's all Japanese style!

18:00.408 --> 18:01.870
It's stone! Stone!

18:01.870 --> 18:03.122
Stone! Stone!

18:03.122 --> 18:04.124
I heard it's hand-etched.

18:04.124 --> 18:05.001
Hand-etched?

18:07.005 --> 18:07.924
UNBREAKABLE

18:12.182 --> 18:14.771
Okay... let's get started, Boss!

18:15.438 --> 18:17.234
Boss, take this.

18:18.194 --> 18:19.948
Right. Appreciate it.

18:30.636 --> 18:33.307
The Roundtable meeting shall now resume.

18:33.307 --> 18:34.644
DECEMBER 1ST

18:34.644 --> 18:36.230
SUNRISE

18:36.230 --> 18:36.898
THREE

18:36.898 --> 18:38.819
FIVE

18:38.819 --> 18:40.781
FOUR

18:40.781 --> 18:42.492
NINE

18:42.492 --> 18:44.664
ELEVEN

18:44.664 --> 18:46.585
TEN

18:46.585 --> 18:48.505
EIGHT

18:48.505 --> 18:50.467
SIX

18:50.467 --> 18:52.471
FOUR

18:52.471 --> 18:54.433
TWO

18:54.433 --> 18:56.855
ONE

18:56.938 --> 18:59.819
There are currently four quests in progress.

18:59.819 --> 19:01.155
DECEMBER 1ST

19:01.155 --> 19:02.742
SUNRISE

19:02.825 --> 19:06.708
This round, every quest is open to everyone.

19:06.833 --> 19:08.921
Quest one:

19:09.171 --> 19:12.385
<i>Neutralization of UMA Spring.</i>

19:12.512 --> 19:14.348
Quest two:

19:14.557 --> 19:17.563
<i>Neutralization of UMA Summer.</i>

19:17.772 --> 19:19.567
Quest three:

19:19.901 --> 19:22.782
<i>Capture of UMA Autumn.</i>

19:23.032 --> 19:24.994
Quest four:

19:25.078 --> 19:28.710
<i>Neutralization of UMA Winter.</i>

19:32.802 --> 19:37.018
But before we get to that,
there are a few things that we need to ascertain.

19:37.018 --> 19:38.981
THREE

19:39.314 --> 19:43.699
The first being the location
of the Roundtable stolen by Billy's organization, Under.

19:46.036 --> 19:49.251
I would also like to pinpoint their base
of operations at that time.

19:49.251 --> 19:50.588
DECEMBER 1ST

19:50.588 --> 19:52.173
BEFORE DAWN

19:55.054 --> 19:58.477
The one who'll kill God... is me.

19:58.895 --> 20:02.068
Our goals when it comes to slaying God align.

20:02.695 --> 20:04.323
As seen from his comment about nuclear weapons,

20:04.323 --> 20:07.747
if we leave him unchecked,
many lives may become sacrificed.

20:07.747 --> 20:09.082
DECEMBER 1ST

20:09.082 --> 20:10.669
BEFORE DAWN

20:12.882 --> 20:18.017
Like Apocalypse said,
these quests hold the 100th penalty.

20:18.017 --> 20:20.313
I doubt we will complete them that easily.

20:20.731 --> 20:24.363
Three out of four need to be neutralized.

20:24.906 --> 20:26.325
If we can kill them, we're good.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.287
So...

20:28.747 --> 20:31.251
...why don't we just drop a few nukes on 'em?

20:35.093 --> 20:37.347
What... are you saying, Mr. Billy?

20:37.932 --> 20:40.771
If we do that,
then innocent people will be sacrificed-

20:40.771 --> 20:43.067
Yeah, that's true.

20:43.777 --> 20:46.031
But that's all that we'd lose.

20:48.537 --> 20:51.125
We must apprehend Billy,
crush Under,

20:51.500 --> 20:55.299
find the Roundtable and Artifacts
in Under's possession needed to slay God...

20:55.676 --> 20:57.053
...and take them all!

20:57.805 --> 21:01.646
I'm sure they made their own progress
as a separate organization toward slaying God.

21:02.063 --> 21:03.650
We'll gladly use anything they have.

21:03.984 --> 21:06.488
Nice! We can return the favor with interest!

21:06.948 --> 21:12.333
With that in mind... Andy and Fuko.
There's something I'd like you two to investigate.

21:12.585 --> 21:14.630
Sure! You can count on me, please!

21:15.381 --> 21:18.095
I want you to check
the legitimacy of a certain book.

21:18.471 --> 21:19.347
A book?

21:21.268 --> 21:24.232
There is a chance that the pages
of the book in question hold...

21:24.232 --> 21:28.575
...the past and future events
of this world as penned by a certain Artifact.

21:29.326 --> 21:34.504
Since Billy has rebelled,
not even I know the route from here on out.

21:34.504 --> 21:40.389
To clear these four Quests in this unfamiliar situation,
that book will be paramount.

21:40.724 --> 21:43.145
The past and future put down in...

21:43.730 --> 21:44.732
...a book?

21:45.943 --> 21:49.742
B-But, should we be handling such
an important mission?

21:50.159 --> 21:52.832
I would prefer if you both handle it, in fact.

21:55.754 --> 21:57.382
Once you see it,
the reason will be clear.

21:59.010 --> 21:59.762
This is it.

